     <P>                      关于举办中、西式面点的通知</P>
<P>各位老师，现转发总工会关于举办中、西式面点的通知，请有兴趣的老师积极报名参加，报名表请先交给学校<STRONG>朱玛莉老师</STRONG>，截止日期11月9日。</P>
<P>附总工会通知。</P>
<P>            </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 1" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt">关于举办中、西式面点比赛的通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-outline-level: 1" align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 26.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">为贯彻落实</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">绍市总工办发〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>41</SPAN>号</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">文件精神，展示我校改革发展的成果，激发和调动广大职工学习业务、钻研技术的积极性和主动性，经学校研究决定举办首届</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">中、西式面点比赛</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">。旨在通过比赛进一步提升职工综合技能水平，交流经验、切磋技艺，从整体上推动工运事业发展。现将有关事项通知如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 33.3pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.37" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">一、比赛项目</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 61.2pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 4.37" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">中式：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">馒头制作<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">      </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>花卷制作</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
