<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 35.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">二、参赛办法：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: 35.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">1</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">、</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">每个比赛项目每单位原则上限报两人。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
