<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.25pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">三、报名时间：</SPAN></B><st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2017" Month="11" Day="13" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">11</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">月<SPAN lang=EN-US>13</SPAN>日下午</SPAN></st1:chsdate><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">：<SPAN lang=EN-US>00</SPAN>截止；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.25pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">四、培训、比赛地址：</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">绍兴市鲁迅中路<SPAN lang=EN-US> 460</SPAN>号（绍兴市职工中等专业学校）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
